    "title": "HIGHLIGHTS: Permian defeats Odessa in walk-off fashion - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Trey Francis ,\n1 days ago\nODESSA, Texas (KMID/KPEJ) – Permian defeated Odessa 7-6 in walk-off fashion Tuesday evening. The Lady Panthers got out to a 3-0 start, but the Lady Bronchos would make their way back to take the lead a couple innings later.\nIn the end, Permian would walk it off in the bottom of the 7th to improve to 16-6-1 on the season. Next up, the Lady Panthers travel to Midland to face Legacy on Friday evening at 6:30 p.m.\nWith the loss, the Lady Bronchos fall to 12-13 on the season, and they’ll look to bounce back on the road on Friday against Frenship at 6:30 p.m.\nWatch the video above for the highlights.\nCopyright 2026 Nexstar Media, Inc. All rights reserved. This material may not be published, broadcast, rewritten, or redistributed. For the latest news, weather, sports, and streaming video, head to Yourbasin.",
